    "note": "Published by reaxlabs/reax-subnet docker.yml on commit eadfb336be40ebdc45f9c6a971fa518754d9e2da (release 1.2.0rc11.post7, tag v1.2.0-rc11.post7). Single-backend miner defaults (per-caller concurrency / per minute / max concurrent): s1-pro 64 / 728 / 16, s1-fast 64 / 888 / 16, pending per IP 128; s1-lite / s1-cpu 32 / 456 / 8, pending 64. From Tue 27 Oct 2026 16:00 UTC, when REAX validators switch, per-hotkey caps are s1-pro 640 decisions/s and s1-fast 2560 decisions/s. s1_cpu_runtime is a multi-arch index (linux/amd64 + linux/arm64); s1_lite_runtime_jetson is the linux/arm64 JetPack build (not yet tested on Jetson hardware)."
